  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Blackguard initiation reward (roadmap: blackguard-quest), given by q_bkg_finish with 1000 XP when the Brand of the Fall is handed to Halmir. Mirrors the sibling prestige rewards' power tier (three +3-tier properties, no AB/damage -- forge-cap-safe): Bluff +3 (skill subtype 23), Use Magic Device +3 (skill subtype 19), Saving Throw Bonus vs Negative +3 (IP_CONST_SAVEVS_NEGATIVE = 12, verified in ovr/nwscript.nss). Skill subtypes 23/19 and save subtype 12 are distinct from all eleven sibling reward items."
  },
